what I'm going to teach. Because the truth is,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:16.980
particularly in states that have passed laws&nbsp;
about these things, they'll just get fired.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:20.640
They'll just get fired. And then that's not going&nbsp;
to help anybody, particularly not the students. So&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:26.809
I think it's going to take a team effort.
Speaker 2: Okay, Well, that helps a lot.&nbsp;

